    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>Energy better; weight up 1.1 kg since intake</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No nausea now; no bleeding</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No sexual side effects</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Positive</td><td>Mild residual low energy on some days; no suicidal thoughts, elevated mood, or racing thoughts</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

